es. Scope and cadence, written down.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"AI marketing automation India,AI outreach agent,GTM for startups,WhatsApp sales automation,AI sales agent SMB India\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://nebulaa.ai\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Engagements — How We Work | Nebulaa\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Three shapes of managed engagement: always-on content, market entry, and multi-market regional programmes. Scope and cadence, written down.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@nebulaaai\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Nebulaa.ai — AI Marketing &amp; Outreach for Founders\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Two AI agents. Your entire GTM. Automated.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500;1,600&amp;family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nebulaa\",\"legalName\":\"Noburo Business Services LLP\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\",\"email\":\"hello@nebulaa.ai\",\"description\":\"Nebulaa is a Chennai-based AI marketing company. It builds two agents — Gravity for marketing and Pulsar for outreach — and runs managed marketing engagements for brands across South India.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2025\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Chennai\",\"addressRegion\":\"Tamil Nadu\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"India\"},\"makesOffer\":[{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"price\":\"10000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"description\":\"Reads a website and builds a marketing strategy from it, plans the month, drafts posts, carousels and reels, tracks competitors, runs campaigns and creator collaborations, and handles the social inbox.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"price\":\"15000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"description\":\"Answers enquiries on WhatsApp, email and SMS within minutes, qualifies budget, timeline and fit, scores every lead, and runs broadcasts, automation and voice calling.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"price\":\"20000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"description\":\"Gravity and Pulsar on one account, sharing the same brand memory.\"}}]}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"bg-ground text-ink font-body antialiased\"><nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 border-b border-rule transition-all duration-300 bg-ground/80 backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"transform:translateY(-64px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-7 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><a class=\"flex-shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Nebulaa.ai\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity dark:hidden\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity brightness-110 hidden dark:block\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/></a><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-[38px]\"><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Product<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/channels\">Channels<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/services\">Services<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\">Pricing<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Resources<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Sign in</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black rounded-full px-[22px] py-[11px] shadow-[0_4px_18px_rgba(245,166,35,0.20)] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"bg-ground text-ink min-h-screen\"><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pt-[140px] pb-[90px] max-w-[860px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">Engagements</span><h1 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[40px] md:text-[60px] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-[26px]\" style=\"text-wrap:pretty\">Three shapes of work.<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">Yours is one of them.</span></h1><p class=\"text-[17.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[640px]\">Every engagement gets scoped individually, but they fall into three shapes. Knowing which one you are asking for is most of what a first call establishes — so here they are, with what each actually includes.</p></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pb-[110px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[20px] px-7 md:px-[42px] pt-[36px] pb-9 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/work/always-on-content\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,340px)] gap-x-[60px] gap-y-5 items-start\"><div><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] md:text-[32px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.015em] mb-3\">Always-on content</h2><p class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.68] text-muted mb-5 max-w-[58ch]\">The most common engagement, and the least dramatic. An established business with real customers that goes quiet online for weeks at a time because everyone is busy running it. We take the content off the team entirely and keep it moving.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">What it includes <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"bg-surface-2 border border-rule rounded-[14px] px-5 py-5\"><div class=\"neb-label mb-2.5\">Suited to</div><p class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Established local and regional brands with an existing customer base</p></div></div></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[20px] px-7 md:px-[42px] pt-[36px] pb-9 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/work/market-entry\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,340px)] gap-x-[60px] gap-y-5 items-start\"><div><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] md:text-[32px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.015em] mb-3\">Market entry</h2><p class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.68] text-muted mb-5 max-w-[58ch]\">A brand with a proven product in one market, going into another. The failure mode is sorting distribution first and marketing second, then watching stock sit. This engagement runs demand generation ahead of the launch date and opens distributor conversations alongside it.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">What it includes <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"bg-surface-2 border border-rule rounded-[14px] px-5 py-5\"><div class=\"neb-label mb-2.5\">Suited to</div><p class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Brands taking an existing product into a new city or market</p></div></div></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[20px] px-7 md:px-[42px] pt-[36px] pb-9 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/work/regional-programme\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,340px)] gap-x-[60px] gap-y-5 items-start\"><div><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] md:text-[32px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.015em] mb-3\">Regional programme</h2><p class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.68] text-muted mb-5 max-w-[58ch]\">The largest shape we run. A brand present across several markets or a retail network, where organic content, paid media and on-ground activation all need to happen — and currently happen through different vendors who never speak to each other.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">What it includes <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"bg-surface-2 border border-rule rounded-[14px] px-5 py-5\"><div class=\"neb-label mb-2.5\">Suited to</div><p class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Brands with distribution across several markets, regions or retail networks</p></div></div></a></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[680px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">On results</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[28px] md:text-[38px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-5\">No numbers on these pages yet.</h2><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.68] text-muted mb-4\">We could put growth figures here. Plenty of sites in this category do, and a fair few of those figures contradict themselves from one page to the next.</p><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\">Ours go up when there is client work published with permission behind it, and not before. Until then these pages describe scope and cadence, which are things we can stand behind completely.</p></div></section></main><footer class=\"relative border-t border-rule pt-[60px] pb-[50px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-[50px] lg:gap-[70px]\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-4\"><div class=\"w-[17px] h-[17px] rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 32%, #FFD48A 0%, #F5A623 46%, #A4650B 100%)\"></div><span class=\"font-heading text-[17px] font-normal text-ink\">Nebulaa</span></div><div class=\"font-body text-[13px] text-muted leading-[1.7]\">Chennai, India<br/><a href=\"mailto:hello@nebulaa.ai\" class=\"hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">hello@nebulaa.ai</a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-[70px] gap-y-[40px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-1\">Product</span><a href=\"/product\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Overview</a><a href=\"/product/gravity\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Gravity</a><a href=\"/product/pulsar\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Pulsar</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Pricing</a></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-1\">Services</span><a href=\"/services\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Managed services</a><a href=\"/channels\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Channels</a><a href=\"/work\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Engagements</a><a href=\"/for\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">By industry</a></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-1\">Free</span><a href=\"/tools\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">30 free tools</a><a href=\"/resources\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Downloads</a><a href=\"/compare\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Compare</a><a href=\"/blog\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Playbook</a></div><div class=\"w-full sm:w-[220px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-1\">Weekly GTM Drop</span><p class=\"font-body text-[13px] text-muted leading-[1.6]\">Real GTM experiments, every Monday.</p><form class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 mt-1\"><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full font-body text-[13px] bg-surface-2 border border-rule rounded-lg px-3.5 py-2.5 outline-none focus:border-gold transition-colors text-ink placeholder:text-faint\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full bg-brand-gold text-brand-black font-body font-semibold text-[13px] rounded-lg py-2.5 hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-colors disabled:opacity-60\">Get weekly tips</button></form></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-[50px] pt-6 border-t border-rule flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-[12px] text-muted\">© 2026 Nebulaa. All rights reserved.</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><a href=\"/facts\" class=\"font-body text-[12px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Facts</a><a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"font-body text-[12px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Privacy</a><a href=\"/terms\" class=\"font-body text-[12px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Terms</a></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-03f7c6bc932ce1e3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/91d486bf57bf1762.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"2:I[2846,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[2972,[\\\"972\\\",\\\"static/chunks/972-8c0ee6fabcd1342f.js\\\",\\\"534\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/work/page-fb9b84b148c5c446.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[4707,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[6423,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n8:I[2144,[\\\"972\\\",\\\"static/chunks/972-8c0ee6fabcd1342f.js\\\",\\\"309\\\",\\\"static/chunks/309-526a3bc2ba734d25.js\\\",\\\"878\\\",\\\"static/chunks/878-ed980f2cac33ad8c.js\\\",\\\"739\\\",\\\"static/chunks/739-3ece649a7e02ff75.js\\\",\\\"185\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-5a72189eaa6243d0.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n9:I[6194,[\\\"972\\\",\\\"static/chunks/972-8c0ee6fabcd1342f.js\\\",\\\"309\\\",\\\"static/chunks/309-526a3bc2ba734d25.js\\\",\\\"878\\\",\\\"static/chunks/878-ed980f2cac33ad8c.js\\\",\\\"739\\\",\\\"static/chunks/739-3ece649a7e02ff75.js\\\",\\\"185\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-5a72189eaa6243d0.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nb:I[1060,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n7:T5c5,{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Nebulaa\\\",\\\"legalName\\\":\\\"Noburo Business Services LLP\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https