es quiet online for weeks at a time because everyone is busy running it. We take the content off the team entirely and keep it moving.\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\",\"children\":[\"What it includes \",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1ays0h\",{\"d\":\"M5 12h14\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"xquz4c\",{\"d\":\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-surface-2 border border-rule rounded-[14px] px-5 py-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"neb-label mb-2.5\",\"children\":\"Suited to\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\",\"children\":\"Established local and regional brands with an existing customer base\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",\"market-entry\",{\"href\":\"/work/market-entry\",\"className\":\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[20px] px-7 md:px-[42px] pt-[36px] pb-9 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,340px)] gap-x-[60px] gap-y-5 items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] md:text-[32px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.015em] mb-3\",\"children\":\"Market entry\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.68] text-muted mb-5 max-w-[58ch]\",\"children\":\"A brand with a proven product in one market, going into another. The failure mode is sorting distribution first and marketing second, then watching stock sit. This engagement runs demand generation ahead 